base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-05T20:33:12-08:00","id":1285110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1231193-geist-kickstarter-discussion-thread?p=1284246#post1284246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was just looking through the backer manuscript again and I realized that there was no section on how other splats saw the Bound or how they see the other splats. Was this cut for word count reasons, or is this something to expect in more games moving forward? Sorry if this has already been discussed, but I haven't read through this entire thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think that's been in any of the 2e books, so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-05T22:22:24-08:00","id":1285124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1231193-geist-kickstarter-discussion-thread?p=1284246#post1284246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was just looking through the backer manuscript again and I realized that there was no section on how other splats saw the Bound or how they see the other splats. Was this cut for word count reasons, or is this something to expect in more games moving forward? Sorry if this has already been discussed, but I haven't read through this entire thread.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1231193-geist-kickstarter-discussion-thread?p=1285110#post1285110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't think that's been in any of the 2e books, so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah they're in some of them...just not all of them<br /> <br /> Werewolf, Demon, and Beast have them. But Vampire, Mage, Promethean, and Changeling do not have Stereotypes on the other gameline splats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T01:07:44-08:00","id":1292092,"title":"","content":"So seems like the corebook is now going through its second proof.<br /> <br /> Additionally, Memento Mori has moved into Development.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T04:36:14-07:00","id":1300512,"title":"","content":"I pledged 25 $ for the kickstarter. It was my first time, someone knows how and when they'll send me my rewards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T06:08:50-07:00","id":1300530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1231193-geist-kickstarter-discussion-thread?p=1300512#post1300512\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I pledged 25 $ for the kickstarter. It was my first time, someone knows how and when they'll send me my rewards?</div> </div> </div> </div>Those aren't being released yet, as far as I know. It can depend on which rewards you are after.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T07:58:42-07:00","id":1300552,"title":"","content":"My rewards must be: the 2nd ed rulebook PDF, the Memento Mori PDF and the ready-made characters PDF.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T10:19:21-07:00","id":1300584,"title":"","content":"Ipergigio,<br /> Those rewards will be sent when the products are ready. Onyx Path wisely stopped giving estimated release dates since doing so led to bad things in the past. In general, their policy is that they will release the products as soon as they are ready, but not before. Proofing is where Onyx Path makes sure that the PDF looks correct. This includes all details such as text wrapping around images, depth of color, position of text boxes, and general layout. This can involve anywhere from 2 - 20 proofs (although the standard is less than 10 if I remember correctly) and each one involves a back-and forth with DrivethruRPG (Onyx Path's PDF fulfillment partner).<br /> <br /> For the items produced as part of a Kickstarter campaign (which all of your are), backers will be sent a preview PDF first. We will have a couple of weeks to submit any errors that we notice. The developer will then look at the collected errata and make any needed corrections. The PDF will then be finalized, prepared for print, and an updated (finalized) version will be sent to the backers before it goes on sale to the public. Since Onyx Path wants to generate more sales, it is in their best interest to get the products to the backers as soon as feasible, so understand that most delays are based on making the product better.<br /> <br /> You will receive notices via e-mail with links to each product as they become available. The links will take you to DrivethruRPG's website where you can download the PDF files. You will have to create an account if you don't already have one, but there is not an additional charge. You have already paid for the products via Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> Congratulations on picking Geist as your first Onyx Path kickstarted project. It is a great game and we are happy to have you join the fan club!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":693,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/693-thomasm","user":"ThomasM","date":". 03-28-2019, 01:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/693-thomasm","name":"ThomasM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar693_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T11:15:50-07:00","id":1300619,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the information, I'm just starting to feel a bit impatient after awaiting for all this time!","signa