"title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-02T07:07:35-07:00","id":1301894,"title":"","content":"And then if they sign off on it, it'll be out to backers in the next few weeks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-03T10:30:02-07:00","id":1302258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1231193-geist-kickstarter-discussion-thread?p=1300619#post1300619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for the information, I'm just starting to feel a bit impatient after awaiting for all this time!</div> </div> </div> </div>Onyx Path states an expected delivery date in the Kickstarter reward listings to help backers manage their expectations. The products are starting to be shipped earlier than those dates but that may not always be the case.<br /> <br /> While onyx Path produced the book, the IP (intellectual property) is owned by White Wolf Publishing. They have to give their approval before Onyx Path can send the PDF to the backers and strt the production process for the print copies.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachmen