order=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-18T13:13:32-08:00","id":1355682,"title":"","content":"And I got to the Haunt section and I am in love. <br /> <br /> Or more accurately terror of the Void, but that's a bad guy ability; you aren't going to learn it and expect people to think you're a good person, because I'll bet even the Chthonic Gods look upon you and go <b>&quot;Oh balls, we've got a psycho, point them far away from us.&quot;</b> The Well is the kind of thing I desperately want to build a character around now, though, because the Well is something that could save a whole bunch of people at almost the same rate it strips agency away from them. I can imagine Pilgrims seeing learning it as fundamental to learning how to find enlightenment, while different Pilgrims want to burn any book with it, because it takes away the right to release yourself from your material self on your own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://foru